  "description": "Adult novel writer Sung Min-ah receives feedback from her publishing company that her 19+ scenes are too weak. As sales drop and harsh criticisms pour in, her editor, Do-hyeon, persistently demands revisions. Sexual intercourse, learned only through writing at home! She's never even done it before, so how is she supposed to write about it? Ah, no. Wait. She can just try it, right? Where on earth is she supposed to find a man as cool as the male lead in her work? To gain inspiration for her work, Min-ah sets out to experience it firsthand. Will she actually be able to find the alpha male of her dreams?\nSource: MU",
